      "description": "QAOA on weighted MaxCut for random weighted regular and non-regular graphs, evaluating proposed parameter-setting rules against optimized parameters and the prior transfer rule from Ref. [9] across multiple depths and weight distributions.",
      "algorithm": {
        "family": "qaoa",
